1
00:00:02,460 --> 00:00:05,255
<c.simplifiedchinese>说好了哦？我只是把它借给你</c.simplifiedchinese>

2
00:00:05,341 --> 00:00:06,676
<c.simplifiedchinese>一定要好好还给我</c.simplifiedchinese>

3
00:00:08,682 --> 00:00:09,891
<c.simplifiedchinese>明白了</c.simplifiedchinese>

4
00:00:09,976 --> 00:00:12,228
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下一定会回来把它还给你的</c.simplifiedchinese>

5
00:00:12,313 --> 00:00:14,441
<c.simplifiedchinese>你就在道场安心等在下回来吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

6
00:00:18,075 --> 00:00:19,201
<c.simplifiedchinese>那好</c.simplifiedchinese>

7
00:00:24,504 --> 00:00:25,589
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心！</c.simplifiedchinese>

8
00:00:29,766 --> 00:00:31,309
<c.simplifiedchinese>（斩奸状 今晚零点在镇守森林）</c.simplifiedchinese>

9
00:00:31,393 --> 00:00:32,978
<c.simplifiedchinese>（里头的稻荷神社前等你 刃卫）</c.simplifiedchinese>

10
00:01:03,834 --> 00:01:07,087
<c.simplifiedchinese>（原作：和月伸宏
集英社《周刊少年JUMP》）</c.simplifiedchinese>

11
00:02:30,464 --> 00:02:32,300
<c.simplifiedchinese>别用那种眼神盯着我</c.simplifiedchinese>

12
00:02:32,385 --> 00:02:36,389
<c.simplifiedchinese>我抓你来不是要吃了你</c.simplifiedchinese>

13
00:02:36,476 --> 00:02:38,353
<c.simplifiedchinese>我知道！</c.simplifiedchinese>

14
00:02:38,439 --> 00:02:40,774
<c.simplifiedchinese>你是为了削弱剑心的实力</c.simplifiedchinese>

15
00:02:40,861 --> 00:02:43,405
<c.simplifiedchinese>人人惧怕的黑笠竟是这种卑鄙小人</c.simplifiedchinese>

16
00:02:43,490 --> 00:02:45,576
<c.simplifiedchinese>你不懂</c.simplifiedchinese>

17
00:02:46,371 --> 00:02:50,333
<c.simplifiedchinese>我把你绑为人质 拔刀斋就会愤怒</c.simplifiedchinese>

18
00:02:50,421 --> 00:02:54,967
<c.simplifiedchinese>愤怒会让那家伙
重新变成昔日的刽子手</c.simplifiedchinese>

19
00:02:55,056 --> 00:02:58,309
<c.simplifiedchinese>如今的拔刀斋很没出息</c.simplifiedchinese>

20
00:02:58,395 --> 00:03:01,690
<c.simplifiedchinese>抽一根烟的功夫 我就能打败他</c.simplifiedchinese>

21
00:03:02,195 --> 00:03:04,113
<c.simplifiedchinese>这样就太无趣了</c.simplifiedchinese>

22
00:03:05,409 --> 00:03:07,995
<c.simplifiedchinese>不仅卑鄙无耻 还大言不惭</c.simplifiedchinese>

23
00:03:08,082 --> 00:03:11,126
<c.simplifiedchinese>你怎么可能不了解剑心的实力？</c.simplifiedchinese>

24
00:03:12,465 --> 00:03:14,842
<c.simplifiedchinese>你才不了解</c.simplifiedchinese>

25
00:03:14,929 --> 00:03:17,389
<c.simplifiedchinese>刽子手拔刀斋</c.simplifiedchinese>

26
00:03:17,475 --> 00:03:18,684
<c.simplifiedchinese>他的实力</c.simplifiedchinese>

27
00:03:18,769 --> 00:03:21,814
<c.simplifiedchinese>让人听到他的故事就会浑身战栗</c.simplifiedchinese>

28
00:03:26,118 --> 00:03:29,162
<c.simplifiedchinese>我第一次见到那家伙…</c.simplifiedchinese>

29
00:03:29,249 --> 00:03:31,793
<c.simplifiedchinese>是在幕末的京都</c.simplifiedchinese>

30
00:03:31,878 --> 00:03:34,548
<c.simplifiedchinese>我听说过刽子手的传言</c.simplifiedchinese>

31
00:03:34,634 --> 00:03:38,054
<c.simplifiedchinese>但我们可是新选组</c.simplifiedchinese>

32
00:03:38,142 --> 00:03:40,811
<c.simplifiedchinese>对手单枪匹马 我们绝不可能输</c.simplifiedchinese>

33
00:03:40,897 --> 00:03:42,566
<c.simplifiedchinese>然而…</c.simplifiedchinese>

34
00:03:57,847 --> 00:03:59,557
<c.simplifiedchinese>只用了一瞬间</c.simplifiedchinese>

35
00:04:00,060 --> 00:04:02,438
<c.simplifiedchinese>月光照在小巷的一瞬</c.simplifiedchinese>

36
00:04:02,523 --> 00:04:06,611
<c.simplifiedchinese>他就把除我之外的三个人全都杀了</c.simplifiedchinese>

37
00:04:08,243 --> 00:04:09,119
<c.simplifiedchinese>喂！</c.simplifiedchinese>

38
00:04:09,997 --> 00:04:11,457
<c.simplifiedchinese>告诉你们的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

39
00:04:12,251 --> 00:04:16,339
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果你们再继续杀害维新志士
就由我来当你们的对手</c.simplifiedchinese>

40
00:04:17,470 --> 00:04:18,346
<c.simplifiedchinese>明白？</c.simplifiedchinese>

41
00:04:34,212 --> 00:04:37,173
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果我那时和他交手</c.simplifiedchinese>

42
00:04:37,260 --> 00:04:40,721
<c.simplifiedchinese>恐怕顷刻之间就被送上黄泉了</c.simplifiedchinese>

43
00:04:41,309 --> 00:04:43,144
<c.simplifiedchinese>但现在不一样了</c.simplifiedchinese>

44
00:04:43,230 --> 00:04:46,817
<c.simplifiedchinese>我杀过很多人 不论是敌是友</c.simplifiedchinese>

45
00:04:49,158 --> 00:04:53,413
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在我和那家伙一样都是刽子手</c.simplifiedchinese>

46
00:04:54,043 --> 00:04:58,423
<c.simplifiedchinese>同为刽子手 进行殊死搏斗一决生死</c.simplifiedchinese>

47
00:04:59,137 --> 00:05:01,306
<c.simplifiedchinese>没什么比这更有意思</c.simplifiedchinese>

48
00:05:01,391 --> 00:05:02,350
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心他…</c.simplifiedchinese>

49
00:05:02,435 --> 00:05:03,936
<c.simplifiedchinese>你很快就会明白的</c.simplifiedchinese>

50
00:05:04,606 --> 00:05:09,235
<c.simplifiedchinese>我看到的和你看到的那家伙</c.simplifiedchinese>

51
00:05:09,324 --> 00:05:11,993
<c.simplifiedchinese>究竟是什么人</c.simplifiedchinese>

52
00:05:21,931 --> 00:05:23,141
<c.simplifiedchinese>好了</c.simplifiedchinese>

53
00:05:25,314 --> 00:05:27,107
<c.simplifiedchinese>刚好零点</c.simplifiedchinese>

54
00:05:27,193 --> 00:05:30,154
<c.simplifiedchinese>真正的享乐时间开始了</c.simplifiedchinese>

55
00:05:30,783 --> 00:05:33,661
<c.simplifiedchinese>是吧 拔刀斋？</c.simplifiedchinese>

56
00:05:33,747 --> 00:05:34,790
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心！</c.simplifiedchinese>

57
00:05:42,181 --> 00:05:43,724
<c.simplifiedchinese>不错的眼神</c.simplifiedchinese>

58
00:05:43,809 --> 00:05:45,769
<c.simplifiedchinese>你很愤怒 是吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

59
00:05:45,854 --> 00:05:46,730
<c.simplifiedchinese>是</c.simplifiedchinese>

60
00:05:46,815 --> 00:05:50,110
<c.simplifiedchinese>对于把薰小姐卷进来的你这混蛋</c.simplifiedchinese>

61
00:05:50,197 --> 00:05:53,325
<c.simplifiedchinese>还有没能阻止这件事的我自己
我都很生气</c.simplifiedchinese>

62
00:05:54,247 --> 00:05:55,164
<c.simplifiedchinese>我？</c.simplifiedchinese>

63
00:05:55,916 --> 00:05:57,918
<c.simplifiedchinese>不错…</c.simplifiedchinese>

64
00:05:58,003 --> 00:06:01,090
<c.simplifiedchinese>你说话的口气又回到幕末了</c.simplifiedchinese>

65
00:06:02,011 --> 00:06:02,929
<c.simplifiedchinese>接下来</c.simplifiedchinese>

66
00:06:03,013 --> 00:06:08,519
<c.simplifiedchinese>把你的刀刃转过来
传说中的刽子手就又苏醒了</c.simplifiedchinese>

67
00:06:08,608 --> 00:06:09,901
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心…</c.simplifiedchinese>

68
00:06:36,121 --> 00:06:37,039
<c.simplifiedchinese>雕虫小技！</c.simplifiedchinese>

69
00:06:37,123 --> 00:06:40,543
<c.simplifiedchinese>不…这不是我平常认识的那个剑心</c.simplifiedchinese>

70
00:06:41,299 --> 00:06:44,260
<c.simplifiedchinese>我不是说过
心之一方在我身上没用吗！</c.simplifiedchinese>

71
00:06:45,557 --> 00:06:47,184
<c.simplifiedchinese>二阶堂平法</c.simplifiedchinese>

72
00:06:47,269 --> 00:06:49,021
<c.simplifiedchinese>首先是…单手平刺！</c.simplifiedchinese>

73
00:06:50,400 --> 00:06:51,401
<c.simplifiedchinese>然后是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

74
00:06:52,195 --> 00:06:54,322
<c.simplifiedchinese>“一”字型的横挥！</c.simplifiedchinese>

75
00:06:54,992 --> 00:06:57,703
<c.simplifiedchinese>“十”字型的竖劈！</c.simplifiedchinese>

76
00:06:58,416 --> 00:06:59,834
<c.simplifiedchinese>在此…</c.simplifiedchinese>

77
00:06:59,919 --> 00:07:01,212
<c.simplifiedchinese>破招！</c.simplifiedchinese>

78
00:07:15,951 --> 00:07:18,787
<c.simplifiedchinese>你看破了我的招式</c.simplifiedchinese>

79
00:07:18,874 --> 00:07:21,334
<c.simplifiedchinese>却没猜到这招“背车刀”</c.simplifiedchinese>

80
00:07:22,631 --> 00:07:24,091
<c.simplifiedchinese>还不够…</c.simplifiedchinese>

81
00:07:24,175 --> 00:07:28,013
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在的你
我用三根烟的时间就能杀掉</c.simplifiedchinese>

82
00:07:28,100 --> 00:07:29,143
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心！</c.simplifiedchinese>

83
00:07:31,189 --> 00:07:32,858
<c.simplifiedchinese>无聊</c.simplifiedchinese>

84
00:07:33,361 --> 00:07:35,488
<c.simplifiedchinese>让你的愤怒之火更旺些吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

85
00:07:46,804 --> 00:07:47,931
<c.simplifiedchinese>薰小姐！</c.simplifiedchinese>

86
00:07:48,015 --> 00:07:51,810
<c.simplifiedchinese>我稍微加强了心之一方</c.simplifiedchinese>

87
00:07:51,898 --> 00:07:54,359
<c.simplifiedchinese>足够让人的肺部麻痹</c.simplifiedchinese>

88
00:07:54,445 --> 00:07:56,697
<c.simplifiedchinese>她最多只能再活两分钟</c.simplifiedchinese>

89
00:07:57,826 --> 00:08:00,537
<c.simplifiedchinese>这回不会像昨晚那么容易破解了</c.simplifiedchinese>

90
00:08:00,624 --> 00:08:03,460
<c.simplifiedchinese>窒息的死相可不怎么好看</c.simplifiedchinese>

91
00:08:03,546 --> 00:08:07,634
<c.simplifiedchinese>口水一地 粪尿横流的</c.simplifiedchinese>

92
00:08:07,721 --> 00:08:09,098
<c.simplifiedchinese>刃卫…</c.simplifiedchinese>

93
00:08:10,101 --> 00:08:12,520
<c.simplifiedchinese>没空闲聊了</c.simplifiedchinese>

94
00:08:13,065 --> 00:08:15,567
<c.simplifiedchinese>想说什么就用剑来回答吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

95
00:08:23,085 --> 00:08:25,671
<c.simplifiedchinese>刚才这一下 不要说出击的一瞬</c.simplifiedchinese>

96
00:08:25,757 --> 00:08:28,093
<c.simplifiedchinese>我连他身体的动作都看不清</c.simplifiedchinese>

97
00:08:28,178 --> 00:08:30,514
<c.simplifiedchinese>这才是飞天御剑流！</c.simplifiedchinese>

98
00:08:30,600 --> 00:08:33,353
<c.simplifiedchinese>这才是刽子手拔刀斋！</c.simplifiedchinese>

99
00:08:36,403 --> 00:08:38,572
<c.simplifiedchinese>没空跟你废话</c.simplifiedchinese>

100
00:08:39,744 --> 00:08:42,830
<c.simplifiedchinese>我会宰了你的 快放马过来吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

101
00:08:47,008 --> 00:08:48,092
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心…</c.simplifiedchinese>

102
00:08:48,678 --> 00:08:50,764
<c.simplifiedchinese>宰了我吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

103
00:08:51,893 --> 00:08:53,102
<c.simplifiedchinese>很好</c.simplifiedchinese>

104
00:08:55,734 --> 00:08:59,154
<c.simplifiedchinese>这才是符合刽子手身份的台词</c.simplifiedchinese>

105
00:08:59,240 --> 00:09:00,533
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心！</c.simplifiedchinese>

106
00:09:03,082 --> 00:09:06,251
<c.simplifiedchinese>你又变回了幕末的刽子手拔刀斋</c.simplifiedchinese>

107
00:09:06,338 --> 00:09:09,174
<c.simplifiedchinese>真正的胜负这才开始！</c.simplifiedchinese>

108
00:09:09,260 --> 00:09:10,887
<c.simplifiedchinese>接招吧 拔刀斋！</c.simplifiedchinese>

109
00:09:14,814 --> 00:09:15,981
<c.simplifiedchinese>怎么了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

110
00:09:17,611 --> 00:09:20,572
<c.simplifiedchinese>杀气四溢 果然不一样了</c.simplifiedchinese>

111
00:09:21,368 --> 00:09:26,373
<c.simplifiedchinese>还想要你这条命的话
就解开薰小姐的心之一方</c.simplifiedchinese>

112
00:09:26,461 --> 00:09:28,463
<c.simplifiedchinese>我已经没法解开了</c.simplifiedchinese>

113
00:09:28,550 --> 00:09:33,012
<c.simplifiedchinese>要么她自己破解 要么杀了施术者</c.simplifiedchinese>

114
00:09:33,643 --> 00:09:35,937
<c.simplifiedchinese>让剑气消失 只有两种选择</c.simplifiedchinese>

115
00:09:36,022 --> 00:09:40,152
<c.simplifiedchinese>当然了 前面那种她绝对做不到</c.simplifiedchinese>

116
00:09:40,239 --> 00:09:43,117
<c.simplifiedchinese>那么 我只能杀掉你了</c.simplifiedchinese>

117
00:09:43,203 --> 00:09:44,872
<c.simplifiedchinese>那也是不可能的</c.simplifiedchinese>

118
00:09:44,957 --> 00:09:50,212
<c.simplifiedchinese>人这种生物 意外地容易被暗示</c.simplifiedchinese>

119
00:09:50,844 --> 00:09:51,970
<c.simplifiedchinese>心之一方就是利用这点</c.simplifiedchinese>

120
00:09:52,054 --> 00:09:56,267
<c.simplifiedchinese>用极高的剑气压倒敌人</c.simplifiedchinese>

121
00:09:56,354 --> 00:09:58,398
<c.simplifiedchinese>让人无法动弹的秘技</c.simplifiedchinese>

122
00:09:58,483 --> 00:10:02,404
<c.simplifiedchinese>暗示可以对身体产生作用！</c.simplifiedchinese>

123
00:10:02,491 --> 00:10:06,245
<c.simplifiedchinese>身为施术者的我也不例外！</c.simplifiedchinese>

124
00:10:12,888 --> 00:10:15,807
<c.simplifiedchinese>吾乃…不败！</c.simplifiedchinese>

125
00:10:16,603 --> 00:10:17,938
<c.simplifiedchinese>原来如此</c.simplifiedchinese>

126
00:10:18,023 --> 00:10:20,859
<c.simplifiedchinese>他向自己施加强烈的暗示</c.simplifiedchinese>

127
00:10:20,946 --> 00:10:23,823
<c.simplifiedchinese>想要激发出全部的力量</c.simplifiedchinese>

128
00:10:24,452 --> 00:10:25,536
<c.simplifiedchinese>吾…</c.simplifiedchinese>

129
00:10:25,621 --> 00:10:26,664
<c.simplifiedchinese>乃…</c.simplifiedchinese>

130
00:10:26,749 --> 00:10:27,792
<c.simplifiedchinese>无敌！</c.simplifiedchinese>

131
00:10:33,095 --> 00:10:36,348
<c.simplifiedchinese>吾乃…最强！</c.simplifiedchinese>

132
00:10:37,688 --> 00:10:41,650
<c.simplifiedchinese>心之一方的衍生技“凭鬼之术”</c.simplifiedchinese>

133
00:10:42,280 --> 00:10:45,950
<c.simplifiedchinese>离开新选组后 我就没再用过</c.simplifiedchinese>

134
00:10:46,747 --> 00:10:48,916
<c.simplifiedchinese>已经过去十五年了</c.simplifiedchinese>

135
00:10:57,518 --> 00:10:59,979
<c.simplifiedchinese>虽然是卑鄙的手段</c.simplifiedchinese>

136
00:11:01,318 --> 00:11:03,111
<c.simplifiedchinese>就让我用吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

137
00:11:03,698 --> 00:11:07,535
<c.simplifiedchinese>无妨 你想用什么招数便用</c.simplifiedchinese>

138
00:11:08,582 --> 00:11:09,458
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过…</c.simplifiedchinese>

139
00:11:16,264 --> 00:11:18,600
<c.simplifiedchinese>既然我说了要杀你…</c.simplifiedchinese>

140
00:11:20,022 --> 00:11:22,274
<c.simplifiedchinese>你的死亡就已经注定！</c.simplifiedchinese>

141
00:11:35,219 --> 00:11:38,514
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是…拔刀术的架势</c.simplifiedchinese>

142
00:11:39,018 --> 00:11:41,020
<c.simplifiedchinese>“拔刀术”</c.simplifiedchinese>

143
00:11:41,106 --> 00:11:45,193
<c.simplifiedchinese>一种从剑鞘中拔出剑刃</c.simplifiedchinese>

144
00:11:45,280 --> 00:11:49,118
<c.simplifiedchinese>使剑速达到两倍或三倍</c.simplifiedchinese>

145
00:11:49,205 --> 00:11:52,375
<c.simplifiedchinese>一瞬间斩杀敌人</c.simplifiedchinese>

146
00:11:52,461 --> 00:11:55,631
<c.simplifiedchinese>追求一击必杀的强力招数</c.simplifiedchinese>

147
00:11:55,717 --> 00:11:57,094
<c.simplifiedchinese>来吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

148
00:11:57,179 --> 00:12:01,600
<c.simplifiedchinese>我会让你切身体会
我这“拔刀斋”名号的由来</c.simplifiedchinese>

149
00:12:02,231 --> 00:12:07,361
<c.simplifiedchinese>神速剑法飞天御剑流使用的拔刀术</c.simplifiedchinese>

150
00:12:07,449 --> 00:12:09,493
<c.simplifiedchinese>可以说是最快的拔刀术</c.simplifiedchinese>

151
00:12:10,164 --> 00:12:12,583
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过…如果躲过这一击 我就赢了</c.simplifiedchinese>

152
00:12:13,211 --> 00:12:15,922
<c.simplifiedchinese>由于拔刀术追求的是一击必杀</c.simplifiedchinese>

153
00:12:16,009 --> 00:12:19,929
<c.simplifiedchinese>一招失败
反而会导致自己的灭亡 很有风险</c.simplifiedchinese>

154
00:12:21,227 --> 00:12:22,437
<c.simplifiedchinese>我能躲过吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

155
00:12:26,029 --> 00:12:27,197
<c.simplifiedchinese>我能</c.simplifiedchinese>

156
00:12:27,281 --> 00:12:28,324
<c.simplifiedchinese>我能躲过这一招！</c.simplifiedchinese>

157
00:12:29,410 --> 00:12:31,162
<c.simplifiedchinese>一决胜负吧！</c.simplifiedchinese>

158
00:12:31,247 --> 00:12:33,166
<c.simplifiedchinese>绯村拔刀斋！</c.simplifiedchinese>

159
00:12:36,633 --> 00:12:40,803
<c.simplifiedchinese>拔刀斋 你忽略了一个致命的问题</c.simplifiedchinese>

160
00:12:40,892 --> 00:12:42,310
<c.simplifiedchinese>你的刀！</c.simplifiedchinese>

161
00:12:42,979 --> 00:12:45,482
<c.simplifiedchinese>逆刃刀会对拔刀术造成障碍</c.simplifiedchinese>

162
00:12:45,567 --> 00:12:50,447
<c.simplifiedchinese>逆刃凸出的弧度在出鞘时</c.simplifiedchinese>

163
00:12:50,535 --> 00:12:53,163
<c.simplifiedchinese>会略微降低拔刀的速度</c.simplifiedchinese>

164
00:12:53,250 --> 00:12:56,670
<c.simplifiedchinese>这一点延迟就是我绝好的胜利机会！</c.simplifiedchinese>

165
00:13:00,305 --> 00:13:03,475
<c.simplifiedchinese>好快！不过我能躲过去！</c.simplifiedchinese>

166
00:13:05,691 --> 00:13:07,150
<c.simplifiedchinese>该我出招了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

167
00:13:07,236 --> 00:13:10,406
<c.simplifiedchinese>我赢了 拔刀斋！</c.simplifiedchinese>

168
00:13:14,417 --> 00:13:17,628
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么…这是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

169
00:13:17,715 --> 00:13:20,092
<c.simplifiedchinese>同时用了刀身和刀鞘的</c.simplifiedchinese>

170
00:13:20,178 --> 00:13:21,847
<c.simplifiedchinese>两段拔刀术？</c.simplifiedchinese>

171
00:13:24,854 --> 00:13:28,482
<c.simplifiedchinese>飞天御剑流拔刀术 “双龙闪”</c.simplifiedchinese>

172
00:13:29,280 --> 00:13:32,283
<c.simplifiedchinese>拔刀术是一击必杀的剑术</c.simplifiedchinese>

173
00:13:32,369 --> 00:13:36,415
<c.simplifiedchinese>我也很清楚逆刃刀不适合用拔刀术</c.simplifiedchinese>

174
00:13:36,502 --> 00:13:40,089
<c.simplifiedchinese>对所有拔刀术了如指掌的男人</c.simplifiedchinese>

175
00:13:40,177 --> 00:13:42,929
<c.simplifiedchinese>这便是“拔刀斋”这个志士名的由来</c.simplifiedchinese>

176
00:13:43,933 --> 00:13:46,519
<c.simplifiedchinese>我击碎了你的肘关节 打断了筋脉</c.simplifiedchinese>

177
00:13:47,358 --> 00:13:49,777
<c.simplifiedchinese>你的剑术生涯已经结束了</c.simplifiedchinese>

178
00:13:49,862 --> 00:13:52,573
<c.simplifiedchinese>接下来就是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

179
00:13:52,659 --> 00:13:54,370
<c.simplifiedchinese>你生命的终结</c.simplifiedchinese>

180
00:13:59,507 --> 00:14:00,758
<c.simplifiedchinese>去死吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

181
00:14:00,842 --> 00:14:02,803
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心…</c.simplifiedchinese>

182
00:14:12,491 --> 00:14:14,451
<c.simplifiedchinese>怎么了 拔刀斋？</c.simplifiedchinese>

183
00:14:14,537 --> 00:14:16,372
<c.simplifiedchinese>你在犹豫什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

184
00:14:16,958 --> 00:14:20,753
<c.simplifiedchinese>想要解除心之一方
只有杀了我一条路</c.simplifiedchinese>

185
00:14:21,467 --> 00:14:23,761
<c.simplifiedchinese>多么简单的选择</c.simplifiedchinese>

186
00:14:24,515 --> 00:14:27,518
<c.simplifiedchinese>传说中的刽子手的凶刃</c.simplifiedchinese>

187
00:14:27,604 --> 00:14:31,108
<c.simplifiedchinese>朝这里砍 送我下黄泉吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

188
00:14:31,946 --> 00:14:33,406
<c.simplifiedchinese>没错</c.simplifiedchinese>

189
00:14:33,491 --> 00:14:36,244
<c.simplifiedchinese>我不想成全你</c.simplifiedchinese>

190
00:14:36,831 --> 00:14:42,712
<c.simplifiedchinese>但为了保护薰小姐
我现在要再做一次刽子手</c.simplifiedchinese>

191
00:14:44,053 --> 00:14:45,513
<c.simplifiedchinese>这就对了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

192
00:14:45,599 --> 00:14:49,311
<c.simplifiedchinese>传说中杀人剑的滋味
让我刃卫好好品尝吧！</c.simplifiedchinese>

193
00:14:49,398 --> 00:14:50,274
<c.simplifiedchinese>去死吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

194
00:14:54,283 --> 00:14:58,245
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑为凶器 剑术为杀人术</c.simplifiedchinese>

195
00:14:58,333 --> 00:15:03,296
<c.simplifiedchinese>不管修饰的多么冠冕堂皇
这终究是事实</c.simplifiedchinese>

196
00:15:03,384 --> 00:15:06,763
<c.simplifiedchinese>但比起事实</c.simplifiedchinese>

197
00:15:07,851 --> 00:15:12,606
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下却更喜欢薰小姐的天真戏言…</c.simplifiedchinese>

198
00:15:14,406 --> 00:15:15,407
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑…</c.simplifiedchinese>

199
00:15:16,244 --> 00:15:17,411
<c.simplifiedchinese>心…</c.simplifiedchinese>

200
00:15:18,748 --> 00:15:19,916
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心！</c.simplifiedchinese>

201
00:15:21,212 --> 00:15:23,923
<c.simplifiedchinese>不要！</c.simplifiedchinese>

202
00:15:28,058 --> 00:15:30,602
<c.simplifiedchinese>不要变回…刽子手…</c.simplifiedchinese>

203
00:15:31,106 --> 00:15:33,108
<c.simplifiedchinese>杀人剑…</c.simplifiedchinese>

204
00:15:33,194 --> 00:15:34,445
<c.simplifiedchinese>不…可以…</c.simplifiedchinese>

205
00:15:34,530 --> 00:15:35,698
<c.simplifiedchinese>薰小姐！</c.simplifiedchinese>

206
00:15:36,450 --> 00:15:39,412
<c.simplifiedchinese>薰小姐 醒醒！你还好吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

207
00:15:40,917 --> 00:15:42,043
<c.simplifiedchinese>薰小姐！</c.simplifiedchinese>

208
00:15:43,046 --> 00:15:45,841
<c.simplifiedchinese>我没事…剑心</c.simplifiedchinese>

209
00:15:45,927 --> 00:15:47,262
<c.simplifiedchinese>哦啰？</c.simplifiedchinese>

210
00:15:47,973 --> 00:15:49,892
<c.simplifiedchinese>你说话的方式…</c.simplifiedchinese>

211
00:15:49,977 --> 00:15:51,645
<c.simplifiedchinese>又变回来了</c.simplifiedchinese>

212
00:15:53,108 --> 00:15:54,610
<c.simplifiedchinese>我没事的…</c.simplifiedchinese>

213
00:15:55,238 --> 00:15:57,824
<c.simplifiedchinese>我没事 所以…</c.simplifiedchinese>

214
00:15:59,622 --> 00:16:02,875
<c.simplifiedchinese>昨晚那个鸡窝头
能解开我的秘术也就算了</c.simplifiedchinese>

215
00:16:02,961 --> 00:16:04,755
<c.simplifiedchinese>没想到连这个小姑娘</c.simplifiedchinese>

216
00:16:04,840 --> 00:16:07,927
<c.simplifiedchinese>都能解开我的心之一方</c.simplifiedchinese>

217
00:16:08,013 --> 00:16:11,266
<c.simplifiedchinese>看来我也变弱了</c.simplifiedchinese>

218
00:16:11,938 --> 00:16:13,189
<c.simplifiedchinese>停手吧 刃卫</c.simplifiedchinese>

219
00:16:13,816 --> 00:16:19,906
<c.simplifiedchinese>只有一把腰刀
还只能用左手 你毫无胜算</c.simplifiedchinese>

220
00:16:19,995 --> 00:16:21,497
<c.simplifiedchinese>一切都结束了</c.simplifiedchinese>

221
00:16:22,166 --> 00:16:24,418
<c.simplifiedchinese>好好接受现实吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

222
00:16:25,172 --> 00:16:27,299
<c.simplifiedchinese>不 还没结束</c.simplifiedchinese>

223
00:16:28,095 --> 00:16:31,473
<c.simplifiedchinese>还有一件事要了结…</c.simplifiedchinese>

224
00:16:38,073 --> 00:16:40,867
<c.simplifiedchinese>这感觉…我喜欢…</c.simplifiedchinese>

225
00:16:48,386 --> 00:16:51,222
<c.simplifiedchinese>别一副什么都不懂的表情</c.simplifiedchinese>

226
00:16:52,268 --> 00:16:53,728
<c.simplifiedchinese>我告诉你了…</c.simplifiedchinese>

227
00:16:54,690 --> 00:16:56,817
<c.simplifiedchinese>还有一件事要了结</c.simplifiedchinese>

228
00:16:56,902 --> 00:17:00,740
<c.simplifiedchinese>万一…万一我被抓住…</c.simplifiedchinese>

229
00:17:00,827 --> 00:17:02,996
<c.simplifiedchinese>随着调查进行</c.simplifiedchinese>

230
00:17:03,081 --> 00:17:05,417
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们一定会找到指使我进行暗杀的</c.simplifiedchinese>

231
00:17:05,503 --> 00:17:09,424
<c.simplifiedchinese>道貌岸然的新政府政客</c.simplifiedchinese>

232
00:17:09,511 --> 00:17:10,345
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

233
00:17:12,058 --> 00:17:14,727
<c.simplifiedchinese>难道你认为到了明治时代</c.simplifiedchinese>

234
00:17:14,813 --> 00:17:18,442
<c.simplifiedchinese>就不需要刽子手了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

235
00:17:19,030 --> 00:17:22,283
<c.simplifiedchinese>这就是为什么我说你没出息了</c.simplifiedchinese>

236
00:17:23,330 --> 00:17:28,001
<c.simplifiedchinese>维新也好 明治也好 新政府也罢</c.simplifiedchinese>

237
00:17:28,090 --> 00:17:33,261
<c.simplifiedchinese>本质上还是和幕末一样
继续着权力的斗争</c.simplifiedchinese>

238
00:17:34,060 --> 00:17:36,104
<c.simplifiedchinese>挡路的人一律除掉</c.simplifiedchinese>

239
00:17:36,189 --> 00:17:41,903
<c.simplifiedchinese>只不过如今制度近代化了
警察机关也重整了</c.simplifiedchinese>

240
00:17:41,992 --> 00:17:46,372
<c.simplifiedchinese>没法光明正大不加掩饰地杀人</c.simplifiedchinese>

241
00:17:46,460 --> 00:17:51,257
<c.simplifiedchinese>同时 一度踏上修罗之路的我
无法脱身</c.simplifiedchinese>

242
00:17:51,344 --> 00:17:53,263
<c.simplifiedchinese>也不想脱身</c.simplifiedchinese>

243
00:17:53,348 --> 00:17:57,352
<c.simplifiedchinese>当政治家和刽子手利害一致</c.simplifiedchinese>

244
00:17:57,440 --> 00:18:02,112
<c.simplifiedchinese>暴徒“黑笠”就诞生了</c.simplifiedchinese>

245
00:18:02,701 --> 00:18:05,912
<c.simplifiedchinese>“刽子手凭自己的意志杀人</c.simplifiedchinese>

246
00:18:05,999 --> 00:18:09,502
<c.simplifiedchinese>但不能选择自己的目标”</c.simplifiedchinese>

247
00:18:10,174 --> 00:18:13,719
<c.simplifiedchinese>我违背了这条规则 向你发出挑战</c.simplifiedchinese>

248
00:18:13,806 --> 00:18:17,185
<c.simplifiedchinese>结果落得这般下场</c.simplifiedchinese>

249
00:18:17,271 --> 00:18:18,689
<c.simplifiedchinese>罢了…</c.simplifiedchinese>

250
00:18:19,358 --> 00:18:24,071
<c.simplifiedchinese>带着残缺的右手活下去也没意思</c.simplifiedchinese>

251
00:18:24,786 --> 00:18:25,787
<c.simplifiedchinese>刃卫…</c.simplifiedchinese>

252
00:18:25,872 --> 00:18:29,375
<c.simplifiedchinese>别用这种眼神看着我 拔刀斋</c.simplifiedchinese>

253
00:18:29,462 --> 00:18:34,926
<c.simplifiedchinese>你说要杀我那时的眼神更好</c.simplifiedchinese>

254
00:18:36,267 --> 00:18:39,520
<c.simplifiedchinese>你的本性果然还是个刽子手</c.simplifiedchinese>

255
00:18:39,608 --> 00:18:42,861
<c.simplifiedchinese>同是刽子手的我不会说错</c.simplifiedchinese>

256
00:18:42,948 --> 00:18:47,077
<c.simplifiedchinese>刽子手到死都是刽子手</c.simplifiedchinese>

257
00:18:47,164 --> 00:18:50,334
<c.simplifiedchinese>成为不了其他的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

258
00:18:50,420 --> 00:18:54,675
<c.simplifiedchinese>你这个浪客能当多久</c.simplifiedchinese>

259
00:18:55,264 --> 00:18:57,808
<c.simplifiedchinese>我会在地狱深处好好见证的</c.simplifiedchinese>

260
00:19:09,626 --> 00:19:13,672
<c.simplifiedchinese>“刽子手到死都是刽子手”</c.simplifiedchinese>

261
00:19:18,476 --> 00:19:19,811
<c.simplifiedchinese>“到死都是…”</c.simplifiedchinese>

262
00:19:22,067 --> 00:19:23,068
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心…</c.simplifiedchinese>

263
00:19:24,823 --> 00:19:27,117
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们回去吧 薰小姐</c.simplifiedchinese>

264
00:19:27,704 --> 00:19:29,998
<c.simplifiedchinese>接下来的事情 与我们无关</c.simplifiedchinese>

265
00:19:30,710 --> 00:19:32,337
<c.simplifiedchinese>交给警察吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

266
00:19:40,145 --> 00:19:41,104
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心…</c.simplifiedchinese>

267
00:19:43,193 --> 00:19:44,235
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心</c.simplifiedchinese>

268
00:19:45,907 --> 00:19:47,283
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么事？</c.simplifiedchinese>

269
00:19:47,911 --> 00:19:50,330
<c.simplifiedchinese>谢谢你救了我</c.simplifiedchinese>

270
00:19:50,415 --> 00:19:52,334
<c.simplifiedchinese>最起码让我说句谢谢</c.simplifiedchinese>

271
00:19:53,881 --> 00:19:54,924
<c.simplifiedchinese>不</c.simplifiedchinese>

272
00:19:55,676 --> 00:19:57,929
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下才应该道谢</c.simplifiedchinese>

273
00:19:58,515 --> 00:19:59,724
<c.simplifiedchinese>感激不尽</c.simplifiedchinese>

274
00:20:00,978 --> 00:20:02,271
<c.simplifiedchinese>呃…不客气？</c.simplifiedchinese>

275
00:20:03,776 --> 00:20:07,363
<c.simplifiedchinese>当时要不是薰小姐阻止了在下…</c.simplifiedchinese>

276
00:20:07,449 --> 00:20:11,245
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下就完全变回刽子手拔刀斋了</c.simplifiedchinese>

277
00:20:13,294 --> 00:20:16,214
<c.simplifiedchinese>对了 你的靛蓝色发带</c.simplifiedchinese>

278
00:20:16,300 --> 00:20:17,844
<c.simplifiedchinese>得还给你来着</c.simplifiedchinese>

279
00:20:17,929 --> 00:20:18,763
<c.simplifiedchinese>啊！</c.simplifiedchinese>

280
00:20:20,267 --> 00:20:21,393
<c.simplifiedchinese>哦啰…</c.simplifiedchinese>

281
00:20:21,477 --> 00:20:23,563
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是什么？全都是血！</c.simplifiedchinese>

282
00:20:23,648 --> 00:20:25,483
<c.simplifiedchinese>是这样啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

283
00:20:25,569 --> 00:20:29,823
<c.simplifiedchinese>一定是我左肩出血时
血流到怀里把它浸透了…</c.simplifiedchinese>

284
00:20:29,911 --> 00:20:31,329
<c.simplifiedchinese>看你干的好事</c.simplifiedchinese>

285
00:20:31,414 --> 00:20:33,166
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是不可抗力！</c.simplifiedchinese>

286
00:20:33,836 --> 00:20:35,629
<c.simplifiedchinese>好过分 我不会放过你的！</c.simplifiedchinese>

287
00:20:36,632 --> 00:20:37,967
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心！</c.simplifiedchinese>

288
00:20:38,052 --> 00:20:40,013
<c.simplifiedchinese>给我站住！</c.simplifiedchinese>

289
00:20:43,939 --> 00:20:48,777
<c.simplifiedchinese>刃卫 在九泉之下好好看着吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

290
00:20:49,408 --> 00:20:51,952
<c.simplifiedchinese>就算本性是刽子手</c.simplifiedchinese>

291
00:20:52,916 --> 00:20:55,210
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下会用余生来压制给你看</c.simplifiedchinese>

292
00:20:55,796 --> 00:21:00,676
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下再也不会成为刽子手拔刀斋了</c.simplifiedchinese>

293
00:21:06,985 --> 00:21:11,823
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下到死为止
都要做一个不杀人的浪客</c.simplifiedchinese>

294
00:21:11,912 --> 00:21:13,288
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们回来了</c.simplifiedchinese>

295
00:21:13,999 --> 00:21:15,251
<c.simplifiedchinese>回家啦</c.simplifiedchinese>

296
00:22:47,394 --> 00:22:50,105
<c.simplifiedchinese>下一集 《逃命的美女》</c.simplifiedchinese>

